      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HENNESSY GOLD (1) broke from a low draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only a neck (22.06) behind Lyndan Diva at this track. Racing well and deserves a win. GOLDEN SPARKLES (8) settled down midfield and held her position to the line when finishing 4th (19.98) at this track. Worth another chance. SPRING RORY (7) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (22.34) at this track behind Craven in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Has never been out of the placings from two starts out of this box. Expected to be in the finish again. MAYWYN PETER (3) was out of the money here last time out but can bounce back.",
